Package: delphyrApp
Title: Trilingual Shiny Workflows for Delphi Studies
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Raban", "Heller", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "58561665+r-heller@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: An English, French and German Shiny interface for synthetic Delphi
    studies, using transactional services from 'delphyr'. Provides panel,
    study-management and editorial workflows with explicit save and submission
    receipts. Production authentication and deployment remain acceptance gates.
